       These functions return the fractional part of _x.

       If _x is a NaN, a NaN is returned, and _*_i_p_t_r is set to a NaN.

       If _x is positive infinity (negative infinity), +0 (-0) is returned, and
       _*_i_p_t_r is set to positive infinity (negative infinity).

